@PLAN.md
Implement plan steps 6 through 10 in order: reader,
sniff, pipeline, agg, render. Test-first for each.
Aggregation is count, count by <field>, top <n>
<field>, p50 and p95 <field>, using the standard
library only (statistics.quantiles); no numpy. After
each step run pytest, ruff, and mypy, show the output,
and commit that step before starting the next.
